Prompt preset

The default prompt preset shipped with Fabulist (`prompts/factory-defaults.json`,
seeded into a fresh install) is original authorship by the Fabulist
contributors and is distributed under the same Apache License, Version 2.0.

The preset of record this project was ported from is the private SillyTavern
preset owned by the project's author. It is NOT included in this repository and
is not redistributed here. Presets, character cards, world-info books and
persona exports that a user imports are that user's material (or their
upstream authors'), are stored as user state, and carry whatever licence their
source attached — importing them does not relicense them.
